Added an opt-in Sync Interface VLANs option to the IP Fabric integration, recording each switchport's 802.1Q mode and the VLANs it carries from IP Fabric's switchport table. An access port gets its access VLAN untagged, a trunk gets its native VLAN untagged and the VLANs it allows tagged, and a trunk allowing every VLAN is recorded as Tagged (All) rather than four thousand tagged VLANs.
